For every evidence upgrade:

1. Search the scoped Profield/Athanor project for discovery only.
2. Read the complete Ahmes node and page context.
3. Resolve Chicago author-date and require `evaluator_safe=yes` for public citation.
4. Keep unresolved records as `[BIBLIO-GAP]` in source-only provenance.
5. Update the evidence matrix, lesson boundary, public References section, and this readiness table together.

### P0-R — research and public-showroom gates

Do not collect, export, analyse, or retain coursework as research data until every required box is complete.

- [ ] UEM DPO has reviewed the pack and named the controller.
- [ ] Lawful basis, retention period, withdrawal process, deletion deadline, and processor/storage locations are written.
- [ ] The possible presence of 17-year-old students has been resolved with the DPO.
- [ ] An independent person administers research consent; participation is grade-neutral and invisible to the instructor until grading is complete.
- [ ] C-set has been versioned, approved, and administered before collection begins.
- [ ] S1/S2 has been administered separately for each exhibited piece.
- [ ] Cross-institutional DPO/approval is added if shared-showroom exhibition activity enters scope.
- [ ] Public-showroom defaults remain private until the signed permission record is linked to the piece.

If these boxes are not complete, teach normally and produce **no research dataset**. This is a valid outcome.

## 3. Release acceptance checklist

- [ ] `npm run build` passes publication and citation checks.
- [ ] If lesson covers were regenerated, the previous generated SVG/PNG/manifest set is present in `digital-creativity-pedagogy/archives/lesson-covers/`.
- [ ] Formula-driven artwork uses only exportable Ahmes formula glossary records, not vector snippets or unverified `normalized_text`.
- [ ] Both home/track indexes link to every intended lesson.
- [ ] No internal metadata appears in `_site`.
- [ ] Every lesson has exactly one semantic and one outcome illustration.
- [ ] References/Referencias is the final visible level-two section when citations are used.
- [ ] The public page contains no answer sketch, consent assumption, invented date, or unsupported learning-effect claim.
- [ ] The release/tag used for teaching is recorded in the Campus Virtual.

## 4. Meaning of “done”

- **Ready to teach:** P0 complete; P1 may continue during preparation.
- **Ready as a polished teaching pack:** P0 + the chosen P1 materials complete.
- **Ready to study:** all P0-R gates complete before data collection.
- **Ready to exhibit:** signed piece-specific S1/S2, plus any cross-institutional approval.
- **Evidence-complete:** not required and probably unattainable; declared pilots remain legitimate when their boundaries are explicit.
